From 84d924fcc717e0e684933a86582136819f2fac5b Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: juanan <juanan@test.com>
Date: Mon, 5 Oct 2026 17:12:08 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 01/10] T0: add infrastructure for the IED extension

- Site settings page (core does not load settings.php for gradingform
  plugins) with three feature flags, all disabled by default:
  enableweighting, enablenumericgrading, enablevalidation.
- New capability gradingform/rubric_ranges:validate (no archetypes).
- New tables gradingform_rubric_ranges_w (criteria weights) and
  gradingform_rubric_ranges_h (validation history) with upgrade step,
  accessed only through the persistent classes criterion_weight and
  validation_history.
- Fork versioning (2024112201 / 2024112200-ied1) and PATCHES.md.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
